# Notification Sound Placeholder

This is a placeholder file indicating where a notification sound file should be placed.
To enable notification sounds:

1. Add a notification.mp3 file to the /public directory
2. Ensure the file is a valid MP3 audio file
3. Keep the file size small (< 100KB) for quick loading

The notification sound will play when:
- New WhatsApp messages arrive from clients (not own messages)
- The user is currently viewing the WhatsApp screen

Note: Audio autoplay may be blocked by browser policies until the user
interacts with the page.
